From 78ec85134f6b90d89b525263935f6ec0a0026ccd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oleksii Zakharov <contact@zalexdev.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 19:38:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] um: arm64: initial ARCH=um SUBARCH=arm64 subarch

Adds arch/arm64/um/ and the arch/um/ changes needed to stop assuming x86.
Builds and links with make ARCH=um SUBARCH=arm64 LLVM=1.

Checkpoint commit; to be split into an upstreamable series.

Signed-off-by: Oleksii Zakharov <contact@zalexdev.com>
